Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:24:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Make the review screen match the prototype's review entry

- Intro callout and Suggested chips on fields that still hold the extracted value,
  instead of a repeated candidate line under every field.
- Filing, tax lines and revision history become collapsible groups; tax lines and
  history start closed unless they have content.
- Confirm review is the primary action, Save draft secondary.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
